LAIRS & SentiNet Architecture (Public Overview)

This document describes the public, high-level architecture for the LAIRS & SentiNet platform.
It focuses on structure, governance, trust boundaries, and system roles.

It intentionally omits:

production implementations

cryptographic material

deployment-specific configurations

exploit-relevant details

1) Platform at a Glance

LAIRS is the cognitive runtime
(memory, identity, reasoning, policy).

SentiNet is the secure fabric
