| Agent /   |→  |  LAIRS    |→  |  Forge    |→  |  Human    |→  |  Apply  |
| Gate / AV |   | Reasoning |   | Proposal  |   | Master    |   | (reboot |
+-----------+   +-----------+   +-----------+   | Admin     |   | boundary)
                                                   +-----------+
                                                         |
                                                         v
                                               +-------------------+
                                               | Audit Evidence +  |
                                               | Rollback Path     |
                                               +-------------------+


Principle:

No autonomous system modification.
The system may detect, reason, and propose —
only a human may authorize change,
and only through controlled staging with rollback.

